♪ Oh oh, she is a beautiful lady,
she looks like a palace... ♪

189
00:11:27,204 --> 00:11:30,245
♪ She is a treasure, she is for me... ♪

190
00:11:30,287 --> 00:11:33,287
♪ Even if her gaze falls on me,
or if she touches me lightly... ♪

191
00:11:33,329 --> 00:11:36,453
♪ I am confirmed to fall flat for her... ♪

192
00:11:36,454 --> 00:11:42,662
♪ She is going to perform an act,
I will blast a remix, in a big way... ♪

193
00:11:42,704 --> 00:11:45,329
♪ She shattered my heart
